[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0010","text":"……那么……\n甘奈，出发了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0020","text":"加、加油……！／加油——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0030","text":"再来一下……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0040","text":"……！／哇！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0050","text":"（嗯……就这样\n　集中精神……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0060","text":"——哇！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0070","text":"小奈……！／甘奈酱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0080","text":"嘿嘿……\n失败了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0090","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400100_04_0100","text":"……再试一次吧☆"}]
